  <button id="stepNext" style="flex:1">Next ▶</button>
</div>
<div id="stepTitle" style="font-weight:600;margin-top:3px">1. The flat region</div>
<div id="stepText" style="line-height:1.35;color:#333">A rectangle rests with one edge on the axis of revolution. Nothing has been revolved yet — this is the generating plane region.</div>

<div style="border-top:1px solid #dcdfe3;margin-top:6px;padding-top:5px;color:#555;line-height:1.35">
  Drag on the figure to orbit: every cross-section perpendicular to the axis is a disk (an annulus for the hollow cylinder).
</div>
<!-- @FIGURE_UI_END -->
// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
// ── ELEMENT SPEC ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// axis of revolution      → CylinderGeometry(0.015,0.015,4.4) rot z -90°, black MeshBasic
// axis see-through ghost  → CylinderGeometry(0.006,...) depthTest:false, grey #888
// rotation arrow          → TubeGeometry(CatmullRom arc r=0.35, 300°, YZ plane @x=2.0) black
